or-2, Rs 69.63 cr, opens 1-Dec.","**Bonlon Industries** -- Rights Issue Committee fixes terms of its already-approved (14-Aug) rights issue: 1,63,83,358 shares at Rs 30 (incl Rs 20 premium), 1-for-1, Rs 49.15 cr, opens 2-Dec.","**VVIP Infratech** -- shareholders approve, at EGM, a preferential issue of up to 72,04,200 convertible warrants at Rs 137 each, aggregating up to Rs 98.70 cr, for working capital and subsidiary investment.","**Tipco Engineering** -- Board approves a preferential issue of up to 9,90,000 shares at Rs 283 (Rs 28.02 cr) to five public allottees and 50,00,000 warrants at Rs 283 (Rs 141.50 cr) to promoter/public allottees, subject to shareholder approval (~Rs 169.50 cr combined, our arithmetic)."],"equity_allotments":["**Dhruva Capital Services** -- discloses the >5% allottee list from its QIP closed 17-Nov: Nova Global Opportunities Fund (12.56%), Venus Investments VCC (12.56%), Monet Securities (9.42%), Saint Capital Fund (9.42%) and Rajasthan Global Securities (8.80%).","**Neetu Yoshi** -- allots 9,48,000 equity shares (Rs 7.39 cr) to 17 allottees on conversion of existing warrants at Rs 78 (the remaining 75% of the exercise price).","**SMT Engineering** -- allots 1,42,858 fresh convertible warrants at Rs 280 to promoters Vishal Jaiswal, Ajay Jaiswal and others, 25% received upfront."],"m_and_a":["**LT Foods** -- US subsidiary LT Foods Americas signs a Stock Purchase Agreement for 100% of MK Foods Holdings (the Maya Kaimal brand), enterprise value USD 5.8 mn, cash-free debt-free, completion within three months.","**Clean Max Enviro Energy** -- step-down subsidiary signs an SPA to acquire 100% of Thailand's GSB Energy Company; consideration not disclosed.","**Jio Financial Services** and **BlackRock** each subscribe to 12,30,00,000 shares of their 50:50 JV Jio BlackRock Asset Management, Rs 123 cr aggregate, on a rights-issue basis.","**3B BlackBio Dx** -- Belgian subsidiary Coris Bioconcept agrees to acquire 100% of Bilex SRL, the landlord of its own plant; consideration not disclosed.","**Tipco Engineering** -- Board approves raising its Ranks Precision buyout to 100% (from 50%) for Rs 29.14 cr, and converts its proposed Hanutech Engineering partnership into an outright slump-sale purchase of the business; price not disclosed."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 75 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Om Infra** -- H1 FY27 standalone EBITDA up 98.73% YoY to Rs 27.98 cr, PAT up 87.54% to Rs 13.91 cr, revenue up 15.36% to Rs 245.12 cr.","**Physicswallah** -- outlines its FY30 ambition at its first Investor Day: revenue of Rs 9,000-10,000 cr (from Rs 3,900 cr in FY26), 25%+ revenue CAGR FY27-FY30, 20%+ pre-Ind AS EBITDA margin.","**Puravankara** -- launches Purva Cityspire in Kochi, 1,056 homes across six towers, with a GDV of ~Rs 2,000 cr.","**Biocon** -- EU grants marketing authorization for its pertuzumab biosimilar Pebrilzo, the first biosimilar approved under the EMA's new tailored clinical approach; follows the 16-Nov US FDA approval."],"distress_risk":["**DCM Limited** -- Income Tax Department's Section 154 rectification order raises the tax demand on its demerged textile undertaking (now DCM Nouvelle) to Rs 41.66 cr for AY2019-20, up from an earlier Rs 25.89 cr addition.","**JSW Energy** -- wind subsidiaries win an APTEL appeal against an APERC order; Discoms must now pay the generic tariff instead of the lower Rs 0.50/unit CUF-penalty rate, plus interest; amount not quantified."],"other_notable":["**Genus Power Infrastructures** -- completes its Rs 148.20 cr tender-offer buyback of 47,50,000 shares at Rs 312 each.","**Infinium Pharmachem** -- receives NSE's in-principle approval to migrate its shares from the EMERGE (SME) platform to the Main Board."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)